window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Anira's powers have made her an outcast.</p> <p>Little do her people know she is their only hope.</p> <p>On her own, yet watching from afar, Anira discovers a plot against her tribe. Their chieftain has been stealing everyone's magic and is now eyeing the dragons' powers. He wants it all for himself.</p> <p>With the help of Rosie, a dragon, Anira will attempt the impossible: to stop the chieftain and free her people and the dragons they protect.</p> <p>Together, she and Rosie will fight to save their families and each other.</p>"; 
